      "data": {
        "filepath": "", "lang": "None", "width": 34,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / ORIGINALS 013\nNOIR EXPRESSIVE LEAD\n\nPLAY: MIDI notes open ADSR/VCA.\nAFTERTOUCH changes Morph VCO timbre.\nMOD WHEEL increases StereoEcho wet mix.\n\nMACRO8 A-D recall delay, resonance,\ndrive and pulse-width variations.\nA is dry/dark; D is tense/long echo.\nLIVE restores physical macro positions.\n\nLEFT audio is normalled to RIGHT in\nStereoEcho. Both echo outputs go to host.\nThe patch is NOT BPM-synchronized.\n\nGain: VCA 0.32, HostAudio2 0.22.\nMonitor quietly; no sound has been\nauditioned in a real fork-built DAW.\n"
      },
      "pos": [32, 1]
    }
